+when transmitting data characters, or the sender of this command
+confirms it will now begin suppressing transmission of GAs with
+transmitted data characters.</dd>
+        <dt pn="section-2-1.3">IAC WON'T SUPPRESS-GO-AHEAD</dt>
+        <dd pn="section-2-1.4">The sender of this command demands to begin transmitting, or to
