+command confirms that the sender of data is expected to suppress
+transmission of GAs.</dd>
+        <dt pn="section-2-1.7">IAC DON'T SUPPRESSS-GO-AHEAD</dt>
+        <dd pn="section-2-1.8">The sender of this command demands that the receiver of the
